For the certificate:
LHS = `nabla X (nabla Y ω) - nabla Y (nabla X ω) - nabla (bracket X Y) ω`.
`nabla Y ω = -ω ∘ₗ ∇_Y`. `nabla X (nabla Y ω) = -((-ω ∘ₗ ∇_Y) ∘ₗ ∇_X) = (ω ∘ₗ ∇_Y) ∘ₗ ∇_X = ω ∘ₗ (∇_Y ∘ₗ ∇_X)`.
Similarly `nabla Y (nabla X ω) = ω ∘ₗ (∇_X ∘ₗ ∇_Y)`.
`nabla (bracket X Y) ω = -(ω ∘ₗ ∇_{[X,Y]})`.
LHS = `ω ∘ₗ (∇_Y ∘ₗ ∇_X) - ω ∘ₗ (∇_X ∘ₗ ∇_Y) - (-(ω ∘ₗ ∇_{[X,Y]}))`
= `ω ∘ₗ (∇_Y ∘ₗ ∇_X - ∇_X ∘ₗ ∇_Y) + ω ∘ₗ ∇_{[X,Y]}`
= `ω ∘ₗ (∇_Y ∘ₗ ∇_X - ∇_X ∘ₗ ∇_Y + ∇_{[X,Y]})`
= `ω ∘ₗ (-(R(X,Y)))` [since R = ∇_X∇_Y - ∇_Y∇_X - ∇_{[X,Y]}, so -R = ∇_Y∇_X - ∇_X∇_Y + ∇_{[X,Y]}]
= `-(ω ∘ₗ R(X,Y))` = `curvature X Y ω`. ✓

